<figure class="portal-event-trace" aria-labelledby="portal-event-trace-caption">
  <ol>
    <li>
      <span class="portal-event-trace__number">01</span>
      <span class="portal-event-trace__kind">DOM location</span>
      <strong>Click inside <code>&lt;Modal /&gt;</code></strong>
      <p>The modal is physically rendered beneath <code>#modal-root</code>.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="portal-event-trace__number">02</span>
      <span class="portal-event-trace__kind">React ownership</span>
      <strong>React follows <code>Modal → App</code></strong>
      <p>The portal does not change which component owns the modal.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="portal-event-trace__number">03</span>
      <span class="portal-event-trace__kind">Handler runs</span>
      <strong><code>App</code>'s <code>onClick</code> fires</strong>
      <p>The event bubbles through the React tree, not the DOM tree.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <figcaption id="portal-event-trace-caption">A click begins in the portal’s DOM output but propagates through the React component relationships.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
